- Sabre Mosaic/current APIs and legacy versioned APIs must be treated as separate profiles; check the current catalog for version/deprecation/beta status.
- Travelport TripServices Flights v11 must not be mixed with Universal API legacy schemas. Record GDS/NDC/ticketless differences and returned time limits per capability profile.
- Turn Doc 86 scenarios into executable tests or explicit blocked evidence before enabling an operation.
